@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}
<style>
    /* Scoped to this page. Reuses the site's real shared classes (.hero,
       .hero-overlay, .section-title, .ai-panel-flush) unchanged so nothing
       here affects the Home page, which shares some of those class names —
       every new rule below uses page-only class names (about-*). */

    .about-eyebrow {
        color: var(--brand-teal); background: var(--ai-panel-bg); border: 1px solid var(--ai-panel-border);
        display: inline-flex; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .about-copy p { color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.75; font-size: 15px; }
    .about-copy p + p { margin-top: 1.1rem; }

    .about-story-media { position: relative; }
    .about-story-glow {
        position: absolute; inset: -18% -18% auto auto; width: 220px; height: 220px;
        background: var(--brand-teal); filter: blur(70px); opacity: .28; z-index: 0;
    }
    .about-story-media img {
        position: relative; z-index: 1;
        border-radius: var(--card-radius);
        box-shadow: 0 24px 50px -26px rgba(20,33,61,.4), 0 4px 16px rgba(20,33,61,.08);
        border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    }

    .about-values { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 0 0 56px; }
    .about-value-card {
        background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: var(--card-radius);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 45px -30px rgba(20,33,61,.35), 0 2px 10px rgba(20,33,61,.05);
        padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center;
        transition: transform .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;
    }
    .about-value-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--brand-teal); }
    .about-value-ico {
        width: 44px; height: 44px; margin: 0 auto 16px; background: var(--ai-panel-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--ai-panel-border); border-radius: 12px; color: var(--brand-teal);
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .about-value-card h6 { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .about-value-card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }

    .about-cta-ico {
        width: 44px; height: 44px; margin: 0 auto 14px; background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--ai-panel-border); border-radius: 12px; color: var(--brand-teal);
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .ai-panel-flush .about-cta-copy { color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 420px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

    @@media (max-width: 900px) {
        .about-values { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .about-story-media { margin-top: 32px; }
    }
</style>

<section class="hero d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-center" style="min-height: 260px;">
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container position-relative text-white py-5">
        <span class="about-eyebrow" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:#fff;">About Us</span>
        <h1 class="mb-3 fw-bold">About Online Computer Store</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-0">
            Straightforward advice, honest prices, and genuine computers
            that actually fit the way you use them.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row g-5 align-items-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our story</h2>
            <div class="about-copy">
                <p>
                    Our Online Computer Store began as a single shopfront built on one simple belief: buying a
                    computer shouldn't feel like guesswork. What started as a small, person&#8209;to&#8209;person
                    operation has grown into a full online store offering laptops, desktops, monitors, and
                    accessories from brands people genuinely trust, all while keeping the same human approach
                    we began with.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Every product we stock is something our team has used, tested, or would confidently recommend
                    to a friend. And we've built the site to behave the way a good store should: AI&#8209;assisted
                    search and comparison tools that help you find the right fit without drowning in spec sheets,
                    real order tracking with a dedicated number for every purchase, and a real person reading
                    every message sent through our Contact page, not a form that disappears into nowhere.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="about-story-media">
                <div class="about-story-glow"></div>
                <img src="/images/store-showroom.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="Our showroom" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values">
        <div class="about-value-card">
            <span class="about-value-ico">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h6>Our Expert-Tested Picks</h6>
            <p>Every product is vetted before it's placed on the shelf.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-value-card">
            <span class="about-value-ico">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" /><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" /><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" /><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h6>Real People, Real Help, Original Products</h6>
            <p>AI tools for speed, a human team for anything trickier.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-value-card">
            <span class="about-value-ico">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" /><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8" /><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5" /><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5" /></svg>
            </span>
            <h6>Backed After The Sale</h6>
            <p>Order tracking, warranty support, and no disappearing act.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="ai-panel-flush text-center">
    <span class="about-cta-ico">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z" /></svg>
    </span>
    <h6 class="text-teal text-uppercase small">Curious to know more?</h6>
    <p class="mb-3 about-cta-copy">Reach out any time. We'd genuinely like to hear from you.</p>
    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact" class="btn btn-cta">Get in touch</a>
</div>
